      "uid": "zhcn:5cbd45244817930c2f00656c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然桐生院训练员的\n签约赛马娘快乐米可没有参赛，\n但她们仍按照自己的步调度过了新马级。",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fc110f96d98089ec22809867bcbcef9ab5c051c061481c233b9b566e35495e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
